% IC written by make_ics.py and read as a snapshot restart (RestartFlag 2), so its metallicities are kept
InitCondFile               ics_000
OutputDir                  output
TimeMax                    0.0125             % 4 largest steps
BoxSize                    0.5                % kpc
TimeBetSnapshot            0.003125
TimeBetStatistics          0.05
MaxSizeTimestep            0.003125           % TimeMax/4: snapshots fall on full synchronisation points
DesNumNgb                  32
UnitLength_in_cm           3.085678e21        % 1 kpc
UnitMass_in_g              1.989e43           % 1e10 Msun
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s   1.0e5              % 1 km/s
TurbDiffusionCoefficient   1.0
MaxMemSize                 4000
PartAllocFactor            3.0
